# ============================================================
# plan: end -- what End does, before each routine lets go
# ============================================================
# Run by the host however a run ends (End, labcli end, ctrl end, Ctrl+C, a failed
# step), with every routine still live. Every step is tried: a refused or
# unanswered step, or a state not confirmed, is logged and the next step runs; a
# step for a routine the plan did not load is skipped. Then each routine's own
# shutdown releases its instrument. The whole script has 120 s; a normal end takes
# about 10. It is never started as a plan of its own.
load rPSU rLACO
record every 5 s

# The cooler and the camera: power off, at once
psu1 ch1 off
psu2 ch1 off

# 1. The chamber stops heating and cooling: no power to the heaters, no nitrogen
#    to the shroud. Confirmed from the controller's own flag. The setpoints go to
#    20 C, so a zone turned on later by hand goes to room temperature, not to the
#    last test's -150 or 150 C.
hvc platen off
hvc shroud off
until HoldingTemperature = false within 15 s
hvc platen 20
hvc shroud 20

# 2. The chamber is sealed before anything is done to the pumps: every valve into
#    it closed, each confirmed. Closing a valve is allowed even during a fault. No
#    air is let in: a cold platen would condense moisture, and venting is the
#    operator's deliberate step afterwards.
hvc vent close
hvc fill close
hvc gate close
hvc rough close
until VentValve = false within 15 s
until FillValve = false within 15 s
until GateValve = false within 15 s
until RoughValve = false within 15 s

# 3. The pumps, with the chamber already sealed. The turbo spins down behind the
#    closed gate valve. Its backing, the foreline valve and the roughing pump,
#    stays until it has stopped, which the controller cannot report: hvc stop is
#    refused while the turbo runs, the roughing pump keeps backing it, and the log
#    says to finish at the HMI once the turbo has stopped.
hvc turbo off
hvc stop
until TurboPump = false within 15 s
until VacuumPump = false within 30 s
